<title>FINLAND: Merita says ITT-Sheraton to run Kamp.</title>
<headline>Merita says ITT-Sheraton to run Kamp.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy said on Monday ITT-Sheraton would manage Hotel Kamp in a central Helsinki property owned by Merita.</p>
<p>The hotel would start operations in summer 1999.</p>
<p>International hotel chain ITT-Sheraton is owned by ITT Corp of the United States.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
